                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4">
                <div
                    class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mb-4 p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-500">
                    <span><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-400 mr-1"></span>Grey columns =
